     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Looks like this error was being caused by trying to parse any files as RDF (including binaries, temp files, etc.).  So the fix was simply skipping non-RDF files (and tightening up the error handling too).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
