      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Looks like this error was being caused by trying to parse any files as RDF (including binaries, temp files, etc.).  So the fix was simply skipping non-RDF files (and tightening up the error handling too).</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/55\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/55</a></p>",
